## Execution order recap
1. Spring Security filter chain authenticates (Basic auth) → `@PreAuthorize("hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)")` authorizes.
2. `@Valid @RequestBody` triggers Bean Validation on `OwnerFieldsDto` (`@NotNull/@Pattern/@Size/@Email`). Failure → `MethodArgumentNotValidException` → 400.
